  <meta data-react-helmet="true" name="keyword" content="Bytedance Model, Bytedance AI Model, ByteDance LLM,  Seed AI Model, ByteDance Seed Model, ByteDance AI Research, ByteDance AI Recruitment"/><meta data-react-helmet="true" name="description" content="The ByteDance Seed team was established in 2023, dedicated to discovering new approaches to general intelligence, pushing the boundaries of AI. The team&#x27;s research areas include LLM, speech, vision, world models, infrastructure, AI Infra, and next-generation AI interactions. The team operates labs in China, Singapore, the United States, and other locations."/>
