tion | Introducing the Seed Audio 1.0 Audio Creation Model","Abstract":"A unified framework for joint modeling of voice, sound effects, ambient sound, and other audio elements.","TitleKey":"\u002Fblog\u002Ffrom-speech-to-audio-creation-introducing-the-seed-audio-1-0-audio-creation-model","Cover":"","Thumbnail":"","VideoLink":"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F4xfa4mrskq6oo.mp4","BannerImage":"","MobileCover":"","HomeCover":"","HomeMobileCover":"","HomeMiniCover":"","HomeColorMode":0},"ArticleSubContentZh":{"Title":"从“会说”走向“会创作”｜Seed Audio 1.0 音频创作模型发布","Abstract":"统一框架下联合建模人声、音效和环境声等音频要素","TitleKey":"\u002Fblog\u002Ffrom-speech-to-audio-creation-introducing-the-seed-audio-1-0-audio-creation-model","Cover":"","Thumbnail":"","VideoLink":"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F4xfa4mrskp8vi.mp4","BannerImage":"","MobileCover":"","HomeCover":"","HomeMobileCover":"","HomeMiniCover":"","HomeColorMode":0}},{"ArticleMeta":{"ID":17,"ArticleID":17,"ArticleType":2,"Status":2,"PublishDate":1783515966000,"UpdateTime":1783515966000,"ContentType":2,"ResearchArea":[{"ResearchAreaName":"Models","ResearchAreaNameZh":"模型发布"}]},"ArticleSubContentEn":{"Title":"Beyond Generation, It Understands Design | Introducing Seedream 5.0 Pro","Abstract":"Unleashing professional-grade productivity.","TitleKey":"\u002Fblog\u002Fbeyond-generation-it-understands-design-introducing-seedream-5-0-pro","Cover":"","Thumbnail":"","VideoLink":"https:\u002F\u002Flf3-static.bytednsdoc.com\u002Fobj\u002Feden-cn\u002Flapzild-tss\u002FljhwZthlaukjlkulzlp\u002Fuser-upload\u002F4xfa4mrbuzccm.mp4","BannerImage":"","MobileCover":"","HomeCover":"","HomeMobileCover":"","HomeMiniCover":"","HomeColorMode":0},"ArticleSubContentZh":{"Title":"不止“生成”，更懂“设计” ｜ Seedream 5.0 Pro 发布","Abstract":"释放专业生产力","TitleKey":"\u002Fblog\u002Fbeyond-genera